# The smallest journey: the runner, the sandbox and the comparer working end to end.
desc Open a fake session's chat, type into its composer, and shoot it.
chat
type hello from the smoke journey
shot chat

# What changes from run to run on its own, in the 2560x1600 shots of the main window: the session's age in its sidebar
# row and in the header's state pill, the clock time under the question, and the inspector's values that come from the
# clock (State's age, Since, Started, Running for) or from the run (Session's id, Process's pid and tty, Command's
# scratch paths).
mask chat-main-* 430 250 75 45
mask chat-main-* 1115 118 140 44
mask chat-main-* 1940 325 95 35
mask chat-main-* 2220 256 340 130
mask chat-main-* 2245 770 315 55
mask chat-main-* 2440 825 120 75
mask chat-main-* 2100 1050 460 550
